Package: mermaid2drawml
Type: Package
Title: Convert Mermaid Diagrams to Editable Word Shapes
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "author@example.com")
Description: Converts Mermaid diagrams of any type (flowcharts, sequence,
    class, state, entity-relationship, Gantt, pie, mind map and the others)
    to natively editable Microsoft Word shapes in DrawingML. Mermaid lays out
    and draws the diagram in a headless browser; the browser reports each
    drawn primitive with its computed colours, line styles, fonts and text
    layout, and these are rebuilt as grouped Word shapes with their labels
    inside, so the result matches the browser rendering and themes and
    styles are honoured. Diagrams can be inserted into documents via the
    officer package, for example in R Markdown workflows. Run
    setup_mermaid2drawml() once after installation to install the required
    Node.js packages.
